  "notes": "## What's Changed\n\n### Features\n\n- **Chat attachments**: drop, paste or pick images, text files and PDFs straight into a conversation.\n- **VLM support**: vision models now take images and answer on them. Needs engine 0.1.3 or newer — see [which families it covers](https://github.com/FlashML-org/FreeToken/blob/main/docs/models.md#image-input).\n- Some FTW checkpoints converted by an earlier FreeToken need a repair before the updated engine loads them — the Library does it in place, without downloading the model again.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- On Linux, a self-update through deb or pacman no longer hangs on a password prompt you could not see.\n- API request times in Logs now read in your own time zone.\n- A long engine error no longer stretches the failure dialog past the edge of the window; it scrolls instead.",
